{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國俄勒岡州一間小學周四（15日）發生槍擊，多人受傷，包括兒童。</p><p>施襲者其後被擊斃。</p><p>美國有線新聞網絡（CNN）和哥倫比亞廣播公司（CBS）引述執法部門消息報道，槍擊造成一名成人和3名兒童死亡。</p><p>兩間傳媒其後均報道，槍手年僅16歲；</p><p>CNN稱該名少年為男性。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:53.372064+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T00:49:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:17:42.638149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:36.274690+00:00","content_hash":"3b6b45aa35c9dff510dee2fccac489566f232e01c8ae5ad2ccdaba9344b786a9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}